{"product_id":"uwell-caliburn-g5-koko-lite-35w-pod-system","title":"Uwell Caliburn G5 Koko Lite 35W Pod System","description":"\u003cp\u003eThe Uwell Caliburn G5 Lite KOKO Pod Kit is a stylish and portable pod system of Caliburn G5 series. Working with the new GPP pod cartridges for exceptional flavor, the Caliburn G5 Lite KOKO is constructed of lightweight PC materials, features a frosted shell and signature square KOKO design, adopts a 1600mAh long-lasting battery and draw activated firing system to deliver a max output of 35W.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eQuick Links:\u003cbr\u003e\u003ca title=\"Caliburn GPP Pods\" href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/products\/caliburn-gpp-replacement-pods\"\u003eUwell Caliburn GPP Pods\u003c\/a\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eUwell Caliburn G5 Lite KOKO Pod Kit Features:\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDimensions: 86 x 45 x 18mm\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eWattage Output: Max 35W\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBattery Capacity: 1600mAh\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eFiring System: Draw Activated\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eChassis Construction: PC\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCharging Port: Type-C\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePod Compatibility: Caliburn GPP Pods, Caliburn G3 Pods\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePod Capacity: 3.0ml\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eFilling System: Side Fill\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAirflow System: Adjustable\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePod Construction: PCTG\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePod Connection: Magnetic\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePRO-FOCS 4.0 Flavor Technology\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003ePackage Includes:\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 x Caliburn G5 Lite KOKO Device\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u0